{
  "info": {
    "name": "IGM OffUs E2E Flow",
    "description": "IGM OffUs test cases. Run AFTER a completed ride flow (01-AutoRideFlow).\n\nExpects these env vars from the ride flow:\n- customer_bookingId\n- driver_merchant_id\n- dashboard_token\n\nPrereqs (seed before running):\n1. igm_config for merchant\n2. issue_category igm_category=FULFILLMENT\n3. issue_option igm_sub_category=FLM111\n4. capability_endpoint for IGM dashboard APIs\n5. offus-bap.test.com NOT in value_add_np\n6. allTablesDisabled=true in kv_configs",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "exec": [
          "if(!pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_igm_issue_id\")){",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_igm_issue_id\",\"IGM-\"+Date.now());",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"_igm_issue_id_2\",\"IGM2-\"+Date.now());",
          "  console.log(\"IGM IDs:\",pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_igm_issue_id\"),pm.collectionVariables.get(\"_igm_issue_id_2\"));",
          "}"
        ],
        "type": "text/javascript"
      }
    }
  ],
